<title>GREECE: AGRICULTURAL BANK LAUNCHES FOREX DEPOSIT ACCOUNTS.</title>
<headline>AGRICULTURAL BANK LAUNCHES FOREX DEPOSIT ACCOUNTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-controlled Agricultural Bank said on Monday it introduced deposit accounts in foreign currency for Greek residents following the recent lifting of controls by the Bank of Greece.</p>
<p>Clients may open the new accounts either converting drachmas into foreign currency or directly depositing foreign currency bank notes, it said. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
